{"id":"97c28eede56ea5e4","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md","title":"ZFC Rel Domain","display":"df-zfc-rel-domain — ZFC Rel Domain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-domain","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-domain"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-domain — ZFC Rel Domain","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-domain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-domain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-domain — ZFC Rel Domain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,D\\in V\">\\(R,D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}domain} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall z\\in R\\;\\exists x,y\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup R\\;(z=\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\bigr)\\land\nD=\\{x\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup R:\\exists y\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup R\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}domain} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall z\\in R\\;\\exists x,y\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup R\\;(z=\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\bigr)\\land\nD=\\{x\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup R:\\exists y\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup R\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both coordinates are set-bounded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup\\bigcup R\">\\(\\bigcup\\bigcup R\\)</span>, and the first clause excludes non-pair elements from a candidate relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"R,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}domain} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall z\\in R\\;\\exists x,y\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup R\\;(z=\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\bigr)\\land\nD=\\{x\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup R:\\exists y\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup R\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigcup\\bigcup R","display":false}],"bytes":741,"backlinks":[{"id":"39c10f49239bf771","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2$（参数顺序为 $(D,R)$，see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md]]）"},{"id":"269d3ee333e7fa0e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S$ (typed relation-domain predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]])"},{"id":"14053f662182bedf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3a78929818a246ba","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e20ba01c502e5f1a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{dom}(f)$ (domain, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md]])"},{"id":"a2160ec9261f8f3b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2$ is from [[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]]."},{"id":"102ae3001d5e421b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"14df766fdbba4698","a